        <h3><strong>WEBSITES</strong></h3>
        <p>As used herein, all references to "website" may include, individually, all and/or in any combination, TRUCKCARRIERHUB.COM and any other website produced, managed, and maintained by TruckCarrierHub. The information you provide on a TruckCarrierHub website will be used only for its intended purpose. By doing so, you are giving TruckCarrierHub your permission to use the information for the intended purpose and in accordance with this Global Privacy Notice.</p>
